Spectral / DNG camera matrices from rawtoaces-data (Apache-2.0) are used by
LightCraft as a fallback when a JPEG fit is rejected. This tree does not
embed those tables; the per-photo JPEG fit is the starting colour for
ARW / NEF / RW2.

Sony DRO-off camera-tone knots
------------------------------
Derived by LightCraft from CC0 pixls.us samples (see
`assets/camera-tone/sony-dro-off.json` in the LightCraft tree). The
32 (scene, display) knots are reproduced in the files above.
The original JSON is CC0; the surrounding LightCraft fitting code is
MIT / Apache-2.0.

Adobe DCP / Camera Raw colour remains optional and is not required for
this LightCraft tone path. Adobe assets are not shipped.
